  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_a338446ba1dc48009c58a7cedff8d0f2",
      "statement": "getUserProfile() resolves identity server-side from Session.getActiveUser().getEmail(); the client never sends the email — it lowercases and trims it before matching the Work_Email column of the Users sheet.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Code/Profile.gs#L5-L25",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1fc4a3087d3a4305fa1fb2adeb08af1f5384a7529d84507b554b8a6467baee79:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4696906971764192991639e2f3d55cb5",
      "statement": "On a successful match, getUserProfile joins Users → Enrollments → Beneficiaries by Allstars_ID (captured from the Users row) and calls getPendingTransactions(allstarsId) for the Audit_Log-derived in-progress box, then computes eligibility and returns a single object the frontend consumes wholesale in populateUI.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Code/Profile.gs#L24-L97",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d280b7c073722b70740a6bfe0f066df46d906c269927caffe0f3fa47e411c498:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://Code/Profile.gs#L99-L176",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9a891ec4baed46c1ae8dc2ed258da944c6c2b556374cca7e7ce01b11c363269a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8d248dbfa2124564b6d026e10b4ca6f9",
      "statement": "If no Users row matches the session email, getUserProfile returns {success:false, msg:'...User not found...'}; any thrown exception is caught and returned as {success:false, msg:e.toString()}, so a sheet/schema error degrades to the error state rather than reaching google.script.run's failure handler.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Code/Profile.gs#L178-L182",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7dca2d253440109ad29a977682acddf697e191924490e8f717a634f0e3b0784c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4f73029a012c4fccaa3b9abe4065f324",
      "statement": "Enrollments join is by first matching Allstars_ID row and captures Withdrawal_Count, Current_Enrolled_Date, Last_Withdrawal_Date, Current_Plan, and Investment_Plan; isEnrolled is derived as currentPlan ? true : false, and Investment_Plan is read defensively (null when the column is absent).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Code/Profile.gs#L42-L63",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6a6c5e26875671664a081e9860fec224a85cf4c850febb3fe509cbbef0ee7000:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6c5a104753dd4b71b29b42092f24273e",
      "statement": "The Beneficiaries sheet is an append-only ledger; getUserProfile reads it bottom-up so the first match is the newest active row (becomes beneficiariesJSON) and pushes every matching row into beneficiaryHistory, so the dashboard and beneficiary manager can render the full edit history.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Code/Profile.gs#L65-L94",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:776e0d5cd3316553dcd0468d3fe6554e53d8158bb56afee54ce3674f372c1788:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_053530817c804fe8a561280dc27c6d67",
      "statement": "getPendingTransactions admits an Audit_Log row to the in-progress list only when the Action is in CANCELLABLE_ACTIONS (Enroll, Change Plan, Withdraw), the latest Event_Type is SUBMITTED or EDITED, and isWithinEditableWindow(submittedAt) holds; beneficiary and investment-plan changes are deliberately excluded because they take effect immediately and have no cancel state.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Code/Profile.gs#L216-L254",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b316080bd7068993466fa65941286694a94aef990d13e099b1736caaa8245c0e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b2ebe17239054a099e3416e63949a47d",
      "statement": "isOnProbation is true only when Users.Probation_End is a real Date still in the future; the end date is surfaced as a string for the 'Eligible to enroll after' message.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Code/Profile.gs#L102-L108",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8a6e15c3cafc79743a2c314c521bc41f4ed0b134cac8b10444a446e12985cb35:"
