    {
      "id": "claim_5194bba5513245648ef198b567fa6073",
      "statement": "Tenure's membership-start rule: startDateForMath defaults to Hire_Date but switches to Current_Enrolled_Date when Withdrawal_Count >= 1 and the enrolled date is a real Date, so a re-enrollment after a withdrawal restarts the tenure clock; the dashboard consumes memberSinceDate/tenureY/tenureM from getUserProfile, never the raw enrolledDate column.",
