      "id": "claim_cac7f47a8b0a4c6ca410d1ebeefe5e0a",
      "statement": "The returned object carries the eligibility flags (isOnProbation, isCoolingDown, cooldownEndDate), the tenure tuple (tenureYears 2dp, tenureY, tenureM, memberSinceDate), matchPercent, pendingTransactions, and todayBangkok (today formatted in Asia/Bangkok) — all consumed by populateUI.",
