    {
      "id": "claim_5c4e6e637dad446ab5d5a4892621011d",
      "statement": "checkPlanChangeEligibility is a pre-compute for the change-plan modal variant only; the write-time refusal comes from processChangePlan re-deriving the same max(lastChangeDate, enrollDate)+6 months math, so a stale planChangeStatus is harmless and the server re-validates regardless.",
