      "statement": "Every mutating action ends with showSuccessToast, which after the toast fades forces a home-reload by re-issuing both getUserProfile (→ populateUI) and checkPlanChangeEligibility (→ applyCooldownUI); this is the SPA's substitute for a server round-trip and re-reads canonical sheet state rather than patching the DOM from the action response.",
