      "id": "claim_20b41007ee7448f98c7321ae0fdf00ee",
      "statement": "The sheet names and SPREADSHEET_ID used by getUserProfile come from Config.gs constants (SHEET_USERS, SHEET_ENROLLMENTS, SHEET_BENEFICIARIES), so a sheet rename is a one-line config change; the Beneficiaries ledger read is defensive and degrades to an empty history when the sheet or its columns are absent.",
